v1.0.1
First Version of Change Log

v1.0.2
Updated project name from Assignment & Deadline Manager to TaskTrack.

v1.0.3  
Created the system flowchart for TaskTrack, detailing all program functions, user choices, and process flow.

v1.0.4
Updated project name from TaskTrack to TaskTrack: An Assignment Tracker App for better clarity.

v1.0.5
Updated the project objectives to be more objective.
Adjusted the presentation to match the updated objectives.

v1.0.6
Updated flowchart for easier understanding
Added a beta python code for the app

v1.0.7  
Added new assignment management features, including:
- Editing and updating existing assignments
- Deleting assignments with confirmation
- Marking assignments as completed
- Assignment status tracking (Pending and Completed)
- Priority levels for tasks (Low, Medium, High)
- Overdue task detection and alerts
- Subject-based filtering and search functionality
- Customizable deadline reminders
Updated the project proposal to reflect the newly added features and system capabilities.  
Updated the README file for better clarity, structure, and documentation of current features.

v1.0.7  
Finalized the app and structure has been updated.
